<stringmatch name="kuna-typelib #1: off, the poll result needs a cast and the pollfd is a bare int" min="1" max="1">\(int4\)poll\(&amp;v1,1,a1\) &lt;= 0</stringmatch>
<stringmatch name="kuna-typelib #2: off, revents is a local nothing assigns" min="1" max="1">return v3 &amp; 1;</stringmatch>
<stringmatch name="kuna-typelib #3: auto, the three locals are one pollfd" min="2" max="2">pollfd v1;</stringmatch>
<stringmatch name="kuna-typelib #4: auto, poll takes it and returns int" min="2" max="2">if \(poll\(&amp;v1,1,a1\) &lt;= 0\)</stringmatch>
<stringmatch name="kuna-typelib #5: auto, the result is the member poll wrote" min="1" max="1">return v1\.revents &amp; 1;</stringmatch>
<stringmatch name="kuna-typelib #6: auto, the rlimit copy is a member assignment" min="1" max="1">\.rlim_cur = v[0-9]+\.rlim_max;</stringmatch>
<stringmatch name="kuna-typelib #7: a library file names the members itself" min="1" max="1">return v1\.got &amp; 1;</stringmatch>
